00:03:29.473 --> 00:03:30.306
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:03:30.306 --> 00:03:31.540
- It goes all over the place.

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:32.900
It's like an epic poem.

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:33.850
- Yeah.
- I love it

00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:34.683
